292
00:39:18,998 --> 00:39:22,698
みんなみんな手繋いでGO！
Everyone, holding hands together, let's go!

293
00:39:23,698 --> 00:39:27,498
(変わってるねって) そーなんだ なんて言ったの？ まぁいっか
("You're quirky" "That's right" "What did you say?" "Oh well")

294
00:39:28,158 --> 00:39:32,478
飲み込んじゃってきた言葉も
Even the words we've swallowed down

295
00:39:32,898 --> 00:39:36,538
君と笑った声でほら咲いて
Blooming brightly with the voice we laughed with you,

296
