モーマンタイ！ 好きだってねぇほんと？ (冗談？) わかりそう？ (どっち？) わかんない！ 本当は…
No problem! Do you really mean you like me? (Joking?) Can you tell? (Which?) I don't know! The truth is...

298
00:39:44,118 --> 00:39:49,978
さくらんぼメッセージ 受け取っていっせーのーせで
Take our Sakuranbo Message, ready, set, go!

299
00:39:50,298 --> 00:39:53,738
きっともっとキュンとしちゃうような
It'll surely make your heart flutter even more,

300
00:39:54,038 --> 00:39:58,578
さくらんぼメッセージ つぼみにぎゅっと詰め込んで
Stuffing our Sakuranbo Message tightly into a bud,

301
00:39:58,678 --> 00:40:01,842
君の前では私
In front of you, I...

302
00:40:02,264 --> 00:40:05,244
私らしくいて いいよね？
It's okay to be myself, right?

303
00:40:13,964 --> 00:40:17,664
誰かじゃなくて 君がいいよって
Not just anyone, I want you...

304
00:40:17,844 --> 00:40:19,994
絶対！何度でも言うよ もう一回！
Absolutely! I'll say it as many times as it takes, once more!

305
00:40:20,854 --> 00:40:25,074
好きだってねぇほんと？ わかりそう？ わかんない！
I love you! Hey, is that really true? Can you tell? I don't know!

306
00:40:25,674 --> 00:40:31,644
さくらんぼメッセージ 受け取っていっせーのーせで
Receive my cherry message, ready, set, go!

307
00:40:31,964 --> 00:40:34,644
きっともっとキュンとしちゃうような
I'm sure it'll make your heart flutter even more...

308
00:40:34,844 --> 00:40:43,094
さくらんぼメッセージ つぼみにぎゅっと詰め込んで キミの前では私
Cherry message, packed tightly into a bud, in front of you, I...

309
00:40:43,714 --> 00:40:51,844
らしくいていいよね？ 好きでいていいよね
It's okay to be myself, right? It's okay for you to love me, right?

310
00:41:20,942 --> 00:41:26,342
ねぇ 思い出したんだ そっと涙した日を
Hey, I remembered the days when I quietly shed tears.

311
00:41:26,842 --> 00:41:31,842
さあ 数えてみようか これまで起こした奇跡を
Come on, let's count up all the miracles we've made so far.

312
00:41:32,042 --> 00:41:37,642
ひとつ とまらない脚で ふたつ こえていく夢も
One, with unstoppable feet; two, overcoming dreams...

313
00:41:37,842 --> 00:41:43,342
みっつ つながる絆は 君とひろげてきたんだよ
Three, the bonds connecting us, which I've expanded together with you.

314
00:41:43,842 --> 00:41:48,842
何度でも咲くように 続いてくこの物語
Blooming over and over, this story continues.

315
00:41:49,142 --> 00:41:54,642
まだ見たことのない 景色を探しにゆこう
Let's go search for scenery we've never seen before.

316
00:41:55,042 --> 00:42:05,842
花ひとつずつが小さくても ほら 支え合えたら桜になれるよ
Even if each flower is small, look, if we support each other, we can become cherry blossoms.

317
00:42:06,342 --> 00:42:11,842
ぼくらが繋いだ大きな木は まだ
The large tree we connected is still...

318
00:42:12,142 --> 00:42:18,842
これからも春風に乗って伸びてくのさ
Riding the spring breeze, it will keep growing from now on.

319
00:42:19,342 --> 00:42:29,842
Wow...

320
00:42:40,942 --> 00:42:46,042
甘くほろ苦い夢 “これでいい”か
A bittersweet dream, "Is this fine?"

321
00:42:46,042 --> 00:42:50,642
“これがいい”か 折れかけたあの日
"Is this what I want?" On that day when I almost broke down...

322
00:42:50,842 --> 00:43:01,642
ここに間違いはなくて 正解もなくて自分次第って 怖くて仕方ないけど
There are no mistakes here, no right answers either—everything's up to me. Even though it's terrifying,

323
00:43:01,942 --> 00:43:06,842
“誰か”じゃなくて“君”と見たい 景色は鮮明で
The scenery I want to see with "you", not just anyone, is vivid.

324
00:43:07,042 --> 00:43:14,342
それじゃここで足踏みなんか していられないじゃんっ！
So there's no way we can just mark time here!

325
00:43:14,842 --> 00:43:19,342
無数の星の中 光は君がくれた
Among countless stars, you gave me the light.

326
00:43:19,642 --> 00:43:25,842
Oh Yeah!! もっと！ 超えていけるさ！
Oh Yeah!! Even more! We can transcend it!

327
00:43:26,042 --> 00:43:31,842
SUPERNOVA 起こせ、今！ 何度だって翔べる
Stir up a SUPERNOVA, right now! We can soar no matter how many times!

328
00:43:32,342 --> 00:43:35,842
これは紛れもなく僕らの軌跡
This is unquestionably our trajectory.

329
00:43:47,842 --> 00:43:53,342
こんな現在を愛せるように
So that we can love the present like this...

330
00:43:53,542 --> 00:43:58,642
君に向けて歌おう 心が叫んでる
I'll sing toward you, my heart is crying out.

331
00:43:58,842 --> 00:44:03,642
無数の星の中 光は君がくれた
Among countless stars, you gave me the light.

332
00:44:03,842 --> 00:44:09,342
Oh Yeah!! もっと！ 超えていけるさ！
Oh Yeah!! Even more! We can transcend it!

333
00:44:09,542 --> 00:44:15,342
SUPERNOVA 起こせ、今！ 何度だって翔べる
Stir up a SUPERNOVA, right now! We can soar no matter how many times!

334
00:44:15,642 --> 00:44:19,842
これは紛れもなく僕らの軌跡
This is unquestionably our trajectory.

335
00:44:20,042 --> 00:44:29,642
普通も“あたりまえ”も無い 君が君らしく在れるように もっと！ずっと！届けよう
There is no such thing as "normal" or "taken for granted"—so that you can be truly yourself, more and more! Always! Let's deliver it.

336
00:44:29,842 --> 00:44:37,342
不思議と怖くないんだ 綺麗事、絵空事でもない さぁ、行こう！
Strangely, I'm not scared, it's neither pretty talk nor pipe dreams—come on, let's go!

337
00:44:37,842 --> 00:45:00,648
この物語は終わらない！
This story never ends!

338
00:45:14,896 --> 00:45:19,996
絶対アイドル辞めないで
Never stop being an idol!

339
00:45:20,756 --> 00:45:23,276
輝いてる君を見たい
I want to see you shining brightly.

340
00:45:23,736 --> 00:45:26,416
もう ずっとずっとずっと
Forever and ever and ever...

341
00:45:26,756 --> 00:45:28,936
ステージにいて
Stay on stage!

342
00:45:41,504 --> 00:45:45,704
私がもし君のとこ 離れたなら
If I were to ever leave your side...

343
00:45:46,664 --> 00:45:49,784
君はちょっと寂しくなるかな
Would you feel a little lonely?

344
00:45:50,464 --> 00:45:52,344
いじわる 考える
I'm having mischievous thoughts.

345
00:45:53,064 --> 00:45:58,104
好きな人がいるのなら 内緒にして
If there's someone you like, keep it a secret.

346
00:45:58,724 --> 00:46:04,204
ねえ神様は将来と指輪を どこかに隠してね
Dear God, please hide our future and rings somewhere safe.

347
00:46:04,784 --> 00:46:07,564
君の「好き」に合わせたんだ
I matched myself to your "I like you".

348
00:46:07,784 --> 00:46:09,964
髪の色
Even the color of my hair...

349
00:46:10,484 --> 00:46:13,084
私の中 君だけで
Inside of me, there's only you.

350
00:46:13,724 --> 00:46:16,804
過剰摂取は中毒へ 責任とってね
Overdose leads to addiction, so take responsibility!

351
00:46:17,284 --> 00:46:22,224
大好きです
I love you so much...

352
00:46:24,144 --> 00:46:28,844
絶対アイドル辞めないで
Never stop being an idol!

353
00:46:30,784 --> 00:46:33,064
優しい目も真面目顔も
Your gentle eyes and serious expressions...

354
00:46:33,804 --> 00:46:36,544
全て知ってる私が言う！
I know everything, so I'm telling you!

355
00:46:37,704 --> 00:46:41,144
絶対 空で輝いて
Shine in the sky, always and forever!

356
00:46:42,164 --> 00:46:45,404
星は街じゃ輝かないの
Stars don't shine in the city streets,

357
00:46:45,684 --> 00:46:48,984
眩しい君が世界一だよ
But dazzling you are number one in the world!

358
00:46:49,684 --> 00:46:51,464
好きだ！
I love you!

359
00:47:02,664 --> 00:47:07,004
君の夢は何ですか？ 教えて欲しい
What is your dream? Please tell me.

360
00:47:07,904 --> 00:47:13,404
その夢がアイドルじゃなくても 覚悟はしてるから
Even if that dream isn't being an idol, I'm ready for it.

361
