暗い道に目が慣れずに 踏み出すのも怖かった そんな時 やっと見えた光
And it was scary taking that first step with eyes unadjusted to the dark... But then I finally saw the light.

363
00:47:34,044 --> 00:47:38,724
絶対 君は歌ってて
Definitely, keep on singing!

364
00:47:40,744 --> 00:47:43,244
ただのエゴとわかってても
Even knowing it's pure selfishness...

365
00:47:43,704 --> 00:47:46,044
君はキラキラ衣装が似合う！
Your sparkling outfit suits you so well!

366
00:47:46,684 --> 00:47:50,344
大きなステージで
On a grand stage,

367
00:47:51,024 --> 00:47:55,324
一列でも前で感じたい 今日の歌い方
I want to feel closer than anyone else today's singing style...

368
00:47:57,824 --> 00:48:00,084
なんか好きだなあ
I kind of love it.

369
00:48:01,304 --> 00:48:05,064
君の努力 私の愛 成り立つ この関係は
Your effort, my love—this relationship stands strong.

370
00:48:06,644 --> 00:48:09,224
強くて脆いの 星の幸せを願った
Strong yet fragile, wishing for the star's happiness.

371
00:48:15,764 --> 00:48:21,724
だって君はアイドルよ ずっと
Because you are an idol, forever and ever!

372
00:48:23,784 --> 00:48:29,104
初めて目が合った日から 今日も明日も 君ばかりだ
From the day our eyes first met, today and tomorrow, it's all about you!

373
00:48:30,244 --> 00:48:34,684
絶対 アイドル辞めないで
Never stop being an idol!

374
00:48:35,684 --> 00:48:38,144
これは報われないおとぎ話
This is a fairy tale where unrequited love persists...

375
00:48:38,584 --> 00:48:41,364
恋よりも もっと好きだ
I love you even more than romance.

376
00:48:41,984 --> 00:48:45,964
魔法よどうか 解けないままで
Magic, please stay unbroken...

377
00:49:25,544 --> 00:49:30,064
まだ まだ 小さな蕾だったあの頃
Back when we were still just tiny buds...

378
00:49:30,524 --> 00:49:35,684
冷たい風に震えていたあの頃
Back when we trembled in the cold wind...

379
00:49:36,504 --> 00:49:42,164
誰もが静かに通り過ぎていく日々
Days when everyone quietly passed by...

380
00:49:42,524 --> 00:49:46,984
立ち止まって そっと微笑んでくれた
You stopped and gently smiled at me.

381
00:49:47,984 --> 00:49:52,984
鏡を覗いたって 写真に収めたって
Even if I look in the mirror, even if I capture it in a photo...

382
00:49:53,524 --> 00:50:02,784
ホントの色なんて ずっとわからないまま 遠くで咲き誇った キレイな花のように
Without ever knowing our true colors, we blossomed proudly in the distance, like beautiful flowers.

383
00:50:04,505 --> 00:50:06,725
なれたくて　なれなくて　春を待っていた
Wanting to be, but unable to be, I waited for spring

384
00:50:10,275 --> 00:50:15,325
君の瞳の中　反射した私を見て
Look at me, reflected in your eyes

385
00:50:16,845 --> 00:50:20,985
初めて自分の色を知れたんだ
It was then I first learned my own color

386
00:50:21,485 --> 00:50:24,285
まだ満開じゃないけど
Even though I'm not in full bloom yet

387
00:50:24,545 --> 00:50:28,585
鮮やかな夢を映し出せるよ
