388
00:50:29,385 --> 00:50:32,545
そこに君がいてくれたから
Because you were there with me

389
00:50:33,985 --> 00:50:43,205
la la la...

390
00:50:43,785 --> 00:50:48,925
どれだけ自分をキレイに描いても
No matter how beautifully I portray myself

391
00:50:49,485 --> 00:50:54,185
どれだけ自分を大きく描いても
And no matter how grandly I portray myself

392
00:50:54,945 --> 00:50:59,865
君の目に映る私はいつものように
The me reflected in your eyes is just the same as always

393
00:51:00,345 --> 00:51:05,445
不器用すぎて　凸凹で　でも嫌いじゃなくて
So clumsy, rough around the edges, but I don't hate it

394
00:51:06,305 --> 00:51:16,525
花が咲いた夢を見てた　きっといつか触れてみたいな
I dreamed of flowers blooming, and hoped to touch them someday

395
00:51:17,425 --> 00:51:30,405
花が咲いた夢を見てた　ずっとずっと春を待っていた
I dreamed of flowers blooming, waiting and waiting for spring

396
00:51:31,365 --> 00:51:41,585
曇り空の下　涙に遮られて　光が届かないときても
Beneath cloudy skies, blocked by tears, even when the light cannot reach

397
00:51:42,045 --> 00:51:47,885
昨日と変わらずに　明日に芽を伸ばしてゆこう
Without changing from yesterday, let's stretch our buds toward tomorrow

398
00:51:48,385 --> 00:51:52,525
だって、Reflection
Because, Reflection

399
00:51:53,865 --> 00:52:00,865
そこに君がいてくれるから
Because you are there with me

400
00:52:04,165 --> 00:52:09,245
君の瞳の中　反射した私を見て
Look at me, reflected in your eyes

401
00:52:10,785 --> 00:52:15,065
初めて自分の色を知れたんだ
It was then I first learned my own color

402
00:52:15,545 --> 00:52:18,325
まだ満開じゃないけど
Even though I'm not in full bloom yet

403
00:52:18,585 --> 00:52:22,725
鮮やかな夢を映し出せるよ
I can project a vivid dream

404
00:52:23,965 --> 00:52:31,225
花びら一つ一つを好きになった
I grew to love each and every petal

405
00:52:31,845 --> 00:52:44,545
そこに君が いつも君が いてくれたから
Because you were there, you were always there with me

406
00:54:23,325 --> 00:54:29,045
みんな生誕ライブ見てくれてありがとうございました！
Thank you everyone for watching my birthday live!

407
